 "about": "Labelled phrasings for m11/completeness round 4 (F1), labelled and committed before any run. Each clause is labelled with the op it must draft ({op}) or with noAdd: any step or a placeholder, but never a template that adds (create_*, or a step named Add). verifier-deletes are the round 3 verifier's 32 take-away asks (evidence deletes.txt), verifier-notdeletes its 21 steps that hold a removing word and ask for another action (notdeletes.txt; an op is what the lane's base 568435d3 drafted with Jev off), and new-r4 30 new phrasings of adds, take-aways, changes and mixes. Clauses follow the engine's cut (DescribedSteps.Cut). Relabelled in round 5 by THE ADDING RULE version 2 (the coordinator, 28 Sep 17:30): vn-15, vn-20 and vn-21 carry a take-away sign (deleted, dropped, removed), which version 2 makes a veto, so each is noAdd now (they were create_measure).",
